WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.917
(electronic music)

00:00:04.085 --> 00:00:05.508
- That sounds like a deal we should take.

00:00:05.508 --> 00:00:06.563
(knock on door)

00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:07.942
- Hey, Jim?

00:00:07.942 --> 00:00:09.931
- Oh, hey, Tyler, come on in.

00:00:09.931 --> 00:00:11.432
I'm sorry, you'll have to excuse me,

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:14.439
my daughter's wonderful boyfriend has just

00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:16.918
come in to surprise me.

00:00:16.918 --> 00:00:20.540
I guess I will talk to you soon, buh-bye.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.730
Boy, is it good to see you.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.171
(R&amp;B music)
- Jim, you're gonna

00:00:25.171 --> 00:00:27.001
wanna sit down.

00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:29.034
- What's going on?

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:30.860
- I just gotta get something off my chest,

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.443
but I know it's gonna hurt you.

00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:37.081
It's gonna hurt me.

00:00:37.081 --> 00:00:40.747
Your daughter, Cindy and
I, have both decided to

00:00:40.747 --> 00:00:42.291
go our separate ways.

00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.044
- Well, that sucks,

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:47.136
but I'm sure you'll land
right back on your feet.

00:00:47.136 --> 00:00:48.072
- Thanks.

00:00:48.072 --> 00:00:51.200
- So, we're on for golf
on Saturdays still?

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.033
- Oh, Jim.

00:00:53.841 --> 00:00:56.115
I don't think we can do that.

00:00:56.115 --> 00:00:58.713
Look, you're a great guy and all, but-

00:00:58.713 --> 00:01:00.054
- Are you leaving me?

00:01:00.054 --> 00:01:02.736
- This isn't easy, but I
gotta do what I gotta do.

00:01:02.736 --> 00:01:04.486
- So, just like that?

00:01:06.195 --> 00:01:07.250
You're out of my life?

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.124
- I'm so sorry.

00:01:09.124 --> 00:01:11.482
You're the greatest
father-figure I've ever had.

00:01:11.482 --> 00:01:14.653
- Who am I gonna watch The Fast
and Furious movies with now?

00:01:14.653 --> 00:01:15.708
- Maybe your wife?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.535
- She hates those movies.

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:19.650
(Tyler groans)
I was almost about to invite

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.764
you into my fantasy football league.

00:01:21.764 --> 00:01:25.996
- Jim, stop, you're only
gonna make it worse.

00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:28.716
- I even told all the guys
in the office about you.

00:01:28.716 --> 00:01:31.312
I even told my boss that I

00:01:31.312 --> 00:01:34.805
had a son that I was damn proud of.

00:01:34.805 --> 00:01:38.548
You were always more than my
daughter's boyfriend, Tyler,

00:01:38.548 --> 00:01:40.220
you were my best friend.

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:43.782
- And you were mine, but
the curtains are closing

00:01:43.782 --> 00:01:46.064
and it's time for us
to give our final bow.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:48.828
- Don't we deserve an encore?

00:01:48.828 --> 00:01:51.433
- You always were the dreamer, Jim.

00:01:51.433 --> 00:01:53.302
I'm gonna miss that about you.

00:01:53.302 --> 00:01:57.212
I'm sure Cindy will go out and
find another boyfriend that

00:01:57.212 --> 00:01:59.445
you'll end up bonding with.

00:01:59.445 --> 00:02:02.335
You know, maybe he'll end up
liking the Discovery Channel

00:02:02.335 --> 00:02:06.239
or window treatments, just as much as you.

00:02:06.239 --> 00:02:07.505
- Never.

00:02:07.505 --> 00:02:09.864
- Never say never, Jim.

00:02:09.864 --> 00:02:10.697
Never.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.610
(music stops)
- Tyler, you're still here?

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.110
- Cindy, hey, hey, we were um,

00:02:15.429 --> 00:02:17.055
we were just talking about...

00:02:17.055 --> 00:02:17.888
- Baseball.

00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:19.248
- Baseball, yeah.

00:02:19.248 --> 00:02:22.337
- Okay Tyler, I think
it's time for you to go.

00:02:22.337 --> 00:02:23.420
- Okay, yeah.

00:02:25.439 --> 00:02:28.106
(longing music)

00:02:38.617 --> 00:02:41.534
(beat joins music)

00:02:45.944 --> 00:02:48.861
(electronic music)

00:02:56.614 --> 00:02:59.370
- Reach around.
(sign squeaks)

